    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85580" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-χωρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spacious, extensive,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἅιδης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Luct.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				8.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀριθμοί</span>
			<i>large,</i> 'round' numbers, Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				274.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>divided into many squares</i> or <i>compartments,</i>
			Puchstein <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				p.9
			</span></i>.</div>
